,(Design, develop, and maintain features for a high-performing Digital Asset Management platform., Collaborate closely with UI/UX designers, the Head of Product, and the CTO to deliver solutions that meet customer expectations., Work on integrations with external business systems and services., Contribute to architectural improvements and influence the platform’s long-term technical strategy., Participate in Agile ceremonies and actively engage in solution discussions with the team.) Requirements: React, Remix, OOP, Functional programming, REST API, GraphQL, Git, Relational database, PostgreSQL, TypeScript, CSS, PHP, Laravel, Symfony, SSO, OAuth, Agile, Linux, Kafka, RabbitMQ, Docker, Kubernetes, NX, Cloud Tools: GIT, Agile. Additionally: Sport subscription, Training budget, Private healthcare, Flat structure, Small teams, International projects, Free coffee, Bike parking, Playroom, Shower, Free beverages, Modern office, No dress code.
